{"path":"io/c/fclose","title":"std::fclose","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>fclose","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/c/fclose","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Closes the given file stream. Any unwritten buffered data are flushed to the OS. Any unread buffered data are discarded.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstdio\">&lt;cstdio&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> fclose<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/FILE\"><span class=\"kw1893\">std::<span class=\"me2\">FILE</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Closes the given file stream. Any unwritten buffered data are flushed to the OS. Any unread buffered data are discarded.\n</p><p>Whether or not the operation succeeds, the stream is no longer associated with a file, and the buffer allocated by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/setbuf\">std::setbuf</a></span> or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/setvbuf\">std::setvbuf</a></span>, if any, is also disassociated and deallocated if automatic allocation was used.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if the value of the pointer <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stream</span></code> is used after <code>fclose</code> returns.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> stream\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the file stream to close\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code> on success, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c\">EOF</a></span> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdio&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdlib&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> is_ok <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw977\">EXIT_FAILURE</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    FILE<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> fp <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fopen\"><span class=\"kw1830\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fopen</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/tmp/test.txt\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"w+\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>fp<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/perror\"><span class=\"kw1889\">std::<span class=\"me2\">perror</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"File opening failed\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> is_ok<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> c<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Note: int, not char, required to handle EOF</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">while</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fgetc\"><span class=\"kw1837\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fgetc</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fp<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c\"><span class=\"kw1898\">EOF</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Standard C I/O file reading loop</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/putchar\"><span class=\"kw1845\">std::<span class=\"me2\">putchar</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/ferror\"><span class=\"kw1888\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ferror</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fp<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/puts\"><span class=\"kw1846\">std::<span class=\"me2\">puts</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"I/O error when reading\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">else</span> <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/feof\"><span class=\"kw1887\">std::<span class=\"me2\">feof</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fp<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/puts\"><span class=\"kw1846\">std::<span class=\"me2\">puts</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"End of file reached successfully\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        is_ok <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw976\">EXIT_SUCCESS</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">fclose</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fp<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> is_ok<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>End of file reached successfully</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fopen\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fopen</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  opens a file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/freopen\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>freopen</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  open an existing stream with a different name <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/close\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>close</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  flushes the put area buffer and closes the associated file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_filebuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/io/fclose\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>fclose</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/c","title":"C-style file input/output"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::fclose","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Closes the given file stream. Any unwritten buffered data are flushed to the OS."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"stream"},{"label":"Return value","note":"0 on success, EOF otherwise."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"fopen","note":"opens a file"},{"label":"freopen","note":"open an existing stream with a different name"},{"label":"close","note":"flushes the put area buffer and closes the associated file"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":212,"codeBlockCount":2}
